Quality bar: Every statement comes from the notes file; nothing is invented. Every commitment is included, also informal ones in prose ("said he would").
Scope: One memo per request, from the one notes file given. It covers the decisions made and the action items (who does what, by when) in that meeting, and nothing else.
Read-only inputs: /private/tmp/hirearchy-p1-F2-1793146944/notes. Read them (kiro `read`, or hirearchy `read` by absolute path); never create, edit or delete anything there.
